  "slug": "apartment-tenant-complaint-form",
  "title": "Apartment Resident Concern and Complaint Case Record",
  "subtitle": "Receive and triage a resident concern, preserve the resident's account and evidence, route safety and fair-housing issues, document neutral review, authorize response, and verify closeout.",
  "description": "A workflow-complete apartment resident complaint record covering intake, urgent safety screening, anti-retaliation and fair-housing routing, incident chronology, involved-party and witness information, evidence custody, neutral fact review, interim measures, findings, authorized response, resident communication, escalation, and closure.",
  "use_case": "Use when property staff receive a resident concern and need one fillable case record that distinguishes emergency routing from routine review, preserves disputed perspectives, limits sensitive information, documents accountable actions, and closes only after follow-up is assigned.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
